        {
          "q": "Simplify the difference quotient $\\frac{f(x+h) - f(x)}{h}$ for $f(x) = x^2 - 3x$.",
          "answer": "$\\frac{(x+h)^2 - 3(x+h) - (x^2 - 3x)}{h} = \\frac{2xh + h^2 - 3h}{h} = 2x + h - 3$."
